<!--
  #102: maintenance — the Maintenance destination (ui/maintenance/MaintenanceScreen), its due-work and schedules
  rows (DueItemRow, WhyLines), the schedule detail and editor, the completion flow, maintenance groups, the scan
  completion sheet and the reminder-health screen. English source. Comments carry the ratification ids (master
  plan §17; spec §10.7 S-numbers; P-numbers) and what each placeholder is.

  Vocabulary: a "schedule" is one maintenance obligation on an asset or on a maintenance group; a "round" is one
  occurrence of a group schedule, which each required member completes; the "season" and the "maintenance break"
  are an asset's own periods. Schedule titles, asset, group and subject names, meter units and readings are the
  owner's own text and arrive as placeholders, unchanged. Dates arrive already formatted.
-->
